@startuml
title Graderate Component States

[*] --> WaitingForStartDate : Load Rate

state "Waiting for Start Date" as WaitingForStartDate
state "Active" as Active
state "Expired" as Expired
state "Removed/Archived" as RemovedArchived

WaitingForStartDate : do / checkCurrentDate

Active : entry / updateRate
Active : do / maintainRate

Expired : entry / markAsExpired

RemovedArchived : entry / removeOrArchive

WaitingForStartDate --> Active : [current date >= start date]
Active --> Expired : [finish date reached]
Expired --> RemovedArchived : [one year from expiration date]
RemovedArchived --> [*]

@enduml
